From 980e585e6e58c6f79bcb0eac439d69f50d274288 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:35:06 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(post): group two through openings on one Agie die
 plate

Match both selected rims to the complete retained plate and check their independent cut envelopes before writing the native job.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2977
